  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**Given :** (6)³ div 12+ [(sqrt{81}) × 4] - (28 div 2) + 24 = 43\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 12 and 24\n\n​(6)³ div 24 + [(sqrt{81}) × 4] - (28 div 2) + 12 = 43\n\n216 ÷ 24 + **(9 × 4)**__ - __**(28 ÷ 2)**__ + 12 = 43\n\n__**216 ÷ 24**__ + 36 - 14 + 12 = 43\n\n__**9 + 36**____** + 12**__ - 14 = 43\n\n__**57 - 14**__ = 43\n\n**43 = 43 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n•",
